[1m[38;5;231mHow should `svc status` show health check failures?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA + C (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mHEALTH column with failing check names, plus a failing count in the heading; one line per service[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m A only
     [38;5;246mHEALTH column with failing check names; heading unchanged[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m B + C
